Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 19:11:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(blocks): align native block random offsets

Select the native offset sampler at runtime rather than during Java block bootstrap, before the user selects a protocol. Native Bedrock 1.26.51.1 build 51061372 fixtures establish the signed-coordinate sampler and X/Z-only seed. Keep the original Java offset function outside Bedrock sessions. Center Java bamboo collision boxes and apply the same native origin bias to the model and hitbox. Targeted tests cover sampler bounds, negative coordinates and bamboo origin alignment.
